{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "41bcff016b8854da1e11de02694530927edacc6724c8a0da42413e458999825c", "ja": "一難去ってまた一難？", "zh": "才脱虎口又入狼窝？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dbd71a6c1ca978a4c3d4accd163c038df9893f059412d10b9dc37d8baf5f3791", "ja": "生放送には魔物が潜む？　順調そうに見える\n裏では、綱渡りの状況が続いていた！　奈緒\nたちがトークで時間をつなぎ、瑞希の機転で\nピンチを乗り越え、お互いに絆を深めていく\nアイドル達……この後、衝撃の展開が！？", "zh": "直播中潜藏着魔物？看似一切顺利的\n背后，险象环生的状况仍在持续！奈绪\n她们用谈话填补时间，靠瑞希的机智\n化解危机，偶像们也在彼此之间加深羁绊……\n接下来，竟会出现令人震惊的发展！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "14f3c296a2bd071db332446f82f3d9c027567e5c0039a115915f657e894b8acb", "ja": "（大きな事故もなく、番組は予定通りに進んでいる。\nだが、すべてが順調かというと……）", "zh": "（节目没有发生什么大事故，正按计划进行着。不过，要说一切都顺利的话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f54afab501180dc954c2eaff4ba15f2dfcc9c2a904d1167beb5bbdbc5079d2fb", "ja": "ハア、ハア。このトークパートで時間を稼いで……。\nマ、マズい！　CMが終わる！！", "zh": "呼……呼……趁着这段谈话拖延一下时间……  \n不、不妙！广告要结束了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "606c632b338ebfec3468877035bdec6b4ebee6aa9978b585496199a1110ed625", "ja": "はあ～……ハッ！　見惚れてる場合やなかった。\n『オペラセリア・煌輝座』の特別ミュージカルでした！", "zh": "哈啊～……啊！现在可不是看入迷的时候。  \n这是《歌剧塞莉亚·煌辉座》的特别音乐剧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "edc6e75ca086e371abba8c83de76f4af89825c7f317e0674fd48fb8914d0fc5e", "ja": "とっても素敵なお話だったねぇ。\n素敵すぎて、あたし……まだドキドキしてるよぉ。", "zh": "真是个精彩的故事呢。\n精彩得过头了，我……现在心还怦怦直跳呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "e3713b0e894572a8d1e29d2784390be85ec471cc5b3e8e41c3028a22b8981ab1", "ja": "うんうん！　キラキラしてて、カッコよくて！\nステージから目が離せなかったね♪", "zh": "嗯嗯！闪闪发光的，又帅气！\n让人完全移不开视线呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f078aecbac442eef7e0dda9b6d2dfb54214b66a5daa16ad2b880ddba23fa1bf5", "ja": "（可奈、奈緒、ひなた！\n誰でもいいからカンペに気付いてくれ！）", "zh": "（可奈、奈绪、日向！谁都好，快注意到提词板啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "fafb4056925b1658e19bc37e99aea82a9d7090f51f54ef6bf37269548c6e117b", "ja": "奈緒さん、可奈ちゃん……。\n{$P$}が何か見せてるよぉ？", "zh": "奈绪姐、可奈……\n{$P$}好像在给我们看什么哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "8acccb8b6b248d536b819b9d73b1c571d214f424900309189d2f256c0dfd9aac", "ja": "あ、ほんとだ。\n「着替えが終わらないから、トークで繋いで」？", "zh": "啊，真的耶。\n“因为还没换好衣服，请用聊天拖延一下时间”？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "258c052e87caae8c545951a6fb1e838d90c4aca8c8c2c58b842727f7281977de", "ja": "私らで時間を稼げっちゅーことやな。\nよっしゃ。私が話を振るから、あとは任せた！", "zh": "也就是说，要我们来争取时间吧。好嘞，我来抛话头，剩下的就交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "4a854818da1f296ee8d1e8ffc19ecd63150e306cbf65fa051b3e26f2cebeb40c", "ja": "えーっ！", "zh": "诶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "4a854818da1f296ee8d1e8ffc19ecd63150e306cbf65fa051b3e26f2cebeb40c", "ja": "えーっ！", "zh": "诶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "34ce7e461e11e0db6c23261681445f2b2d88cc3b37e25e3170b83265121d8777", "ja": "歌といえば、可奈ってばいっつも歌ってへん？\nなんや毎日聞いてる気ぃするわ。", "zh": "说到唱歌，可奈她不是总在唱吗？\n总觉得每天都能听到她在唱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "403adb7be66e4420650537c2312fa7f27c6929934bba35c07f5ca59436bf1642", "ja": "でも可奈ちゃんの歌を聞いてると、元気になるんだわ。\nもしかしたら、ミュージカルはピッタリかもねぇ。", "zh": "不过，听着可奈的歌，就会让人打起精神来呢。\n说不定，音乐剧真的很适合她呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "b139898384340fa0df8e4976ebaac5a4dd10f02eadd1e2c4cf6156e125956d2d", "ja": "そ、そうかな？　私、歌は好きだけど、\nお芝居はまだまだ勉強中で……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？我虽然喜欢唱歌，但演戏还在学习中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "91147fccbaf49a6d33ac83141c7801aab7ca4f39e65b48585e7eb9c1d5b78de0", "ja": "よっしゃ！　いっちょミュージカルの練習してみよか！\nほな、どんな設定がええかな～？", "zh": "好嘞！那就来试着练习一下音乐剧吧！\n那么，定个什么样的设定好呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "0b42b8a466511790cfcf0027f8a0e9e8170869ba959fb0a5f019459b163f2f76", "ja": "な、奈緒さん！？　今ですか！", "zh": "奈、奈绪姐！？现在吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f25d7db989de4174255afa135a081ab612c9e8ecba39ae540c5f86c07cd0cdd1", "ja": "（ありがとう、みんな！　よし、急いで楽屋に戻ろう。\n少しでも状況が改善してるといいんだが……）", "zh": "（谢谢大家！好，赶紧回休息室吧。希望情况能哪怕稍微有所好转……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1017_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "1272e79fc1d6c97d13ea743e3bc7af9e57f3995df90e5973df5af9c8e4ff33b2", "ja": "どうだ？　まつりの着替えは終わったか？", "zh": "怎么样？小祭换好衣服了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "438a7cb5a79185c8f85c1432581f80b71cfdf51c27b3b01e0a91cc56554e4a95", "ja": "はいほー！\n姫も変身完了なのです、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "嗨呼——！\n公主也变身完毕了哦，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "283bb2f5ee095fcd866eea922001ba9a1072025481d17a53c0ff1e5bbab3cafd", "ja": "ああ、よかった。\nあれだけ着替えるのに苦戦してたのに、どうして……。", "zh": "啊，那就好。\n明明之前还为换衣服苦战了那么久，怎么会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "cb37d6b9a84ef432fa7f39f2e1f838425f1ca93c167c690752f3c6617bc1690f", "ja": "それは、妖精さんのみらくるな魔法……ではなく！\n瑞希ちゃんのおかげなのです♪", "zh": "那是小精灵的奇迹魔法……才不是！是多亏了瑞希哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "c19863ef1a6d4b4de31197a0907ac19f635283fccec4c4866f61124fa4480898", "ja": "どうも、手先が器用で有名な真壁瑞希です。\n僭越ながら、徳川さんの着替えをお手伝いしました。", "zh": "您好，我是真壁瑞希，以手很灵巧而闻名。  \n冒昧地帮德川小姐换了衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "7ff6f01fe638c6476dcfac6d2697ec4d093317f0dd7ff427e5f01476815d5d8b", "ja": "絡まって固くなった紐を、簡単に解いたのです！\n瑞希ちゃんの手は、魔法の手なのです。", "zh": "把缠在一起变硬的绳子轻松解开了！\n瑞希的手是魔法之手呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "2450b2fa38131b338bf44d730ad4d12e7e253d7e57f74b92ee605490da3036f0", "ja": "そうだったのか。ありがとう、瑞希！\nもっと話したいところだが、まつりは移動の時間だ。", "zh": "原来是这样。谢谢你，瑞希！\n还想再聊一会儿，不过茉莉该走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "fabafe7d9159a730b916ea729d8d18dd2e4747ff8784ab244df573ae539bc166", "ja": "はいなのです。それでは{$P$}さん、\n瑞希ちゃん、また後で……なのです♪", "zh": "好的哦。那么，{$P$}先生，瑞希，待会儿再见……哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "7819f69a5da4f5d19024bc34753f7f5cd77a27740f026d3df5f4541a7add5e08", "ja": "次のコーナー、楽しみにしています。\n……行ってらっしゃい、徳川さん。", "zh": "我很期待下一个环节。\n……一路顺风，德川。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "06f865e7f213f87713cade408a04f9cde95c2f579f9d123f9a9b55492ffbb02e", "ja": "手伝ってくれて、ありがとう。助かったよ！", "zh": "谢谢你帮忙，真是帮大忙了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "81bb9e623bac29720d83408ecf2cd1abf5412cc37f75beb9716822f8a9f8771b", "ja": "いえ。仲間のピンチですから、当然です。\nみんな頑張っているのに、私だけ休むなんて……。", "zh": "不用谢。毕竟是同伴遇到了危机，这是应该的。明明大家都在努力，我却一个人休息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "f7e13e900a041061582b1e2dee3bbe5d6b60db7341817487544b8aea22e64763", "ja": "あっ、そうでした。この時間を使って、\n次のコーナーの予習をしようと思っていたんでした。", "zh": "啊，对了。我本来想利用这段时间，预习一下下一个环节来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1030_p", "source_sha256": "4b81295bc671491374621a7a894ee9fa7c0263049c6f8811d3181e5ab2a9c368", "ja": "でも今は休憩中だろ？　休まないで大丈夫か？", "zh": "不过现在是休息时间吧？不休息真的没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "4cbc2a920d6073119df86bfcff3dc035d030f30e961f6a4e8a7949ab794aa9c1", "ja": "はい、大丈夫です。適度に休みながら、\n台本を読んでいるので問題ありません。", "zh": "是的，没关系。我会适当休息，同时看剧本，所以没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1032_p", "source_sha256": "aa37e09ff0c4f4d0dab2e51ad8c28b5e881fe3168d08b483ad2f7cbf1fb14aa7", "ja": "そういうことじゃないんだが……。\nまあ、大丈夫ならいいんだ。", "zh": "不是那个意思……  \n嗯，没事就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1033_031tom", "source_sha256": "3676dc931d087174aec3021d326abc6f5fda5eccf0738d0f7f1cfd4977e9eaa0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nこんなところで油を売っていていいんですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n在这种地方摸鱼没关系吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "0de4774bc2eaba62741f7e372947197fd83b58a290c288616162b7c1a80015ad", "ja": "お疲れ様、朋花。\nちょうどスタジオに戻るところなんだ。", "zh": "辛苦了，朋花。\n我正准备回摄影棚呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1035_031tom", "source_sha256": "11247a86865016846354f11823fecee1262c21ce090f586ae04752ffff9ffebf", "ja": "悠長に構えている時間ではないのではありませんか？\n先程から、スタッフの方が探していましたよ？", "zh": "现在可不是悠闲等待的时候吧？\n刚才工作人员一直在找您哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1036_p", "source_sha256": "a7c2a51aee94dcb7f5bd47c8b66bca1fd31278436efd397568676403190cac14", "ja": "あれ、今何時だ？\n……ああっ！　この後のコーナーの最終確認！！", "zh": "哎，现在几点了？\n……啊啊！接下来的环节还要做最终确认！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1037_p", "source_sha256": "d3653b621eb724944dd69cbfc124d3f80653c49cf797de58cbcc083847749bd7", "ja": "朋花、教えてくれてありがとう！\nそれじゃふたりとも、何かあったら連絡してくれ！", "zh": "朋花，谢谢你告诉我！\n那么，你们两个，有什么事就联系我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1038_044miz", "source_sha256": "74ae6058d6f03e9becdcba38032e0258ae5b36d7f005be654e1a3526e4baf168", "ja": "{$P$}、忙しそうですね……。\n……見習わないと。", "zh": "{$P$}，看起来很忙呢……。\n……我也得好好学习才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1039_031tom", "source_sha256": "c5b66806aa5e1b0fe1561679df4bb443767b4723449e08bf5793e6b8deab0a48", "ja": "……。瑞希さん、お疲れさまです～。\nそれと、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "……瑞希小姐，辛苦了～。\n还有，谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1041_031tom", "source_sha256": "f27ac0cbd5f63ffe89e652da37c0cf8a11829b214f2ec3db41ef5415ea0a3c09", "ja": "瑞希さん達がしっかりと進めてくださるので、\n私も安心して、ミッションに挑戦できそうです～。", "zh": "有瑞希小姐她们稳妥地推进着，我也可以放心挑战任务了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1042_044miz", "source_sha256": "35ef9ef931e98df8929e1c696e82052eddf96070cb90dad35ab649dab649f7a0", "ja": "たしか……『花咲夜』のみなさんは、\n『THE 39ミッション』の参加メンバーでしたね。", "zh": "我记得……『花咲夜』的各位，是『THE 39任务』的参加成员吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1043_031tom", "source_sha256": "c0b3649920af30fbcc13e3e6dc1cdf5be9bfa82de79c99f673717b327e91453e", "ja": "ええ。紬さんとエミリーちゃんも楽しみにしています。\nもちろん、番組をみている子豚ちゃん達もです～。", "zh": "是的，紬小姐和艾米莉也很期待。当然，还有正在观看节目的小猪们～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1044_031tom", "source_sha256": "2800531fc38600c05df897bdd79e28f6f0d55359661499eacf20a7e579118d05", "ja": "聖母の慈愛を、たくさんの視聴者に届ける機会です。\n瑞希さん、お互いに頑張りましょうね。", "zh": "这是把圣母的慈爱传达给众多观众的机会。瑞希小姐，我们一起努力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0185_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0185_story_03_1045_044miz", "source_sha256": "dadbc34a708a04a4199df9abaee5006fcf5998eedae471e141871d40fa0e59b1", "ja": "天空橋さん……。\nはい、最後までがんばりましょう……！", "zh": "天空桥同学……。\n嗯，我们一起加油到最后吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
